  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Cream with Gold Chain & Mini Pocket, Stay stylish and organized with the Luxury Crossbody Wallet Phone Case. Designed in a chic cream finish with a contrasting brown mini pocket and gold hardware, this case is the perfect blend of fashion and function. The attached gold chain lets you wear it crossbody or over the shoulder, keeping your phone and essentials close at all times. ✨ Features: • Elegant cream case with brown pocket and gold clasp • Built-in mini wallet pocket for cards, cash, or small items • Detachable gold chain for hands-free carrying • Durable, protective design against scratches and drops • Perfect for casual outings, shopping trips, or nights out • Compatible with multiple iPhone models This case isn’t just protection – it’s a statement accessory that doubles as a mini bag.",
  "description_html": "<div>Cream with Gold Chain &amp; Mini Pocket,</div>\n<div>Stay stylish and organized with the Luxury Crossbody Wallet Phone Case. Designed in a chic cream finish with a contrasting brown mini pocket and gold hardware, this case is the perfect blend of fashion and function. The attached gold chain lets you wear it crossbody or over the shoulder, keeping your phone and essentials close at all times.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Elegant cream case with brown pocket and gold clasp</span></div>\n<div><span> • Built-in mini wallet pocket for cards, cash, or small items</span></div>\n<div><span> • Detachable gold chain for hands-free carrying</span></div>\n<div><span> • Durable, protective design against scratches and drops</span></div>\n<div><span> • Perfect for casual outings, shopping trips, or nights out</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with multiple iPhone models</span></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>This case isn’t just protection – it’s a statement accessory that doubles as a mini bag.</div>"
